    "excerpt": "Gulls circle the end of the pier. [Climb the lighthouse] -> lighthouse [Wait for the boats] The boats are late tonight. [Listen to the bell] The bell rings twice. -> pier The stairs wind up into the dark. {not lamp_lit} [Light the lamp] The beam sweeps the water. The boats turn for home.",
